      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At high temperature, the modified grain boundaries enable more uniform dislocation activity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pure tungsten is inherently brittle relative to WTaTiVZr under the proposed high-temperature conditions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "WTaTiVZr will exhibit significantly greater plastic strain before failure than pure tungsten.",
